WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
During the war at Marineford, Blackbeard&nbsp;
rocked one of the core beliefs of the one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:10.080
piece world when he gained the power of a&nbsp;
second devil fruit. And this game-changing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:15.240
power made Blackbeard one of the absolute&nbsp;
strongest characters in the world. But have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:20.220
you ever wondered what might happen if&nbsp;
LUFFY got to eat a second devil fruit as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:26.040
well? And what fruit would be the PERFECT&nbsp;
combo to pair with his original powers?

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:31.020
Well, I figured the ABSOLUTE BEST options and&nbsp;
the first fruit that we are going to explore&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:37.380
as Luffy’s second power is one of THE MOST&nbsp;
POWERFUL devil fruits in the entire story.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:42.540
But it’s not the overpowered Magma fruit&nbsp;
or the even insane abilities of the Law’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:47.640
Operation fruit. So which one is it? Well,&nbsp;
let’s kick things off with the Venom fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:53.160
which is an amazing complement to Luffy’s&nbsp;
rubber abilities, and you will see why in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:59.880
just a second. But this fruit was originally&nbsp;
eaten by the Warden of Impel Down, Magellan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:06.300
and it has unbelievably strong abilities that&nbsp;
are absolutely perfect to pair up with Luffy’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:11.940
current powers. And in case you forgot, this is&nbsp;
a Paramecia type fruit which allows the user to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:17.400
produce different kinds of poison. During the&nbsp;
Impel Down arc, Magellan shot out deadly venom&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:24.360
hydras, traveled quickly through Venom Roads, made&nbsp;
giant clouds of poison gas, and even unleashed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:30.720
this terrifying Venom Demon which could literally&nbsp;
melt through the entire underwater prison.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:37.260
Now you may be wondering why I have chosen this&nbsp;
one as the first option for Luffy’s second fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:43.260
so let me explain. Imagine if we gave Luffy just&nbsp;
a stupidly overpowered devil fruit to combine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:48.360
with his rubber fruit. Maybe something&nbsp;
like Admiral Kizaru’s light fruit. Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:54.540
I could imagine that Luffy wouldn’t use his&nbsp;
rubber powers as often since the light logia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.540 --> 00:02:00.840
fruit is simply a godly power. So instead&nbsp;
of just combining two super powerful fruits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:07.740
I wanted to pick devil fruits that truly&nbsp;
complemented his previous abilities. Plus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:11.940
we have already discussed how powerful&nbsp;
Luffy would be with other devil fruits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:19.680
but giving him a second devil fruit ON TOP of&nbsp;
his regular one is a completely different beast.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:23.760
Now, I’m also going to assume that Luffy&nbsp;
has his second devil fruit powers from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:30.000
the start. Maybe he randomly ate a second one&nbsp;
by accident, although it is equally possible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.800
that he could have eaten a second one after&nbsp;
Blackbeard showed that it was possible after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:39.240
Marineford. Either way, he’d have plenty of&nbsp;
time to master his second devil fruit powers.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:45.060
Which is why the Venom fruit is an absolutely&nbsp;
perfect combo power for Luffy because he can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:51.600
still keep his main fighting style of punches,&nbsp;
kicks, headbutts, but now he can coat his body&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:57.660
with deadly poison so that each of his attacks&nbsp;
deal WAY MORE damage than before because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:04.560
this venom this fruit produces is absolutely&nbsp;
deadly. STRAIGHT UP, if you touch this stuff,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:11.040
it is basically an instant death sentence. Not&nbsp;
only that but having Venom on his body would also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:17.700
be a huge defensive boost since enemies would not&nbsp;
want to touch him at all. He could also use some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:22.500
ranged attacks like these crazy poison gas balls&nbsp;
that Magellan uses during his first clash against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:29.160
Luffy. On top of this he could travel insanely&nbsp;
fast around the massive prison using the venom&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:35.040
roads and he could use gigantic poison attacks&nbsp;
that could take out entire groups of enemies all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:40.860
at once, which would have been perfect during&nbsp;
battles like at Marineford or Fishman island.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:48.840
So CAN YOU IMAGINE JUST. HOW. POWERFUL. this would&nbsp;
make him? His base form would be ridiculously more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:53.880
powerful than in the original story.. And there&nbsp;
are a few specific examples where the poison would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:59.400
make Luffy’s life much easier, in particular&nbsp;
when he gets into super long battles like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:05.520
the epic twelve hour clash against the mochi man&nbsp;
Katakuri or the Emperor Kaido. For these fights,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:10.740
Luffy could build up poison damage over time,&nbsp;
which if you’ve ever played a game like Pokemon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:16.440
you know that a poison buildup can kill you&nbsp;
just as fast as a single massive attack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:22.680
so the longer the fights go on, the weaker Luffy’s&nbsp;
opponents would get. Another example of this power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:28.020
making a fight way easier is against the string&nbsp;
fruit user Doflamingo because Luffy’s deadly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:32.940
poison could easily melt Doffy’s strings&nbsp;
before they even have a chance to cut him.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:39.240
And just imagine how insane Gear 5 poison&nbsp;
man Luffy would be. There are so many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:43.260
crazy things he could do by combining&nbsp;
his limitless imagination and venom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:46.680
such as making sticky venom balls&nbsp;
to throw all around the battlefield,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:52.020
or if he awakened the venom fruit as well,&nbsp;
then he could make the entire environment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:59.520
a poisonous AND bouncy minefield that would be&nbsp;
absolutely impossible for enemies to fight on.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:04.140
However, there are some downsides to this&nbsp;
fruit for Luffy. First, just like Magellan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:08.760
Luffy might get some poison in his food which&nbsp;
would send him straight to the toilet for a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:14.340
whole different kind of battle. But even more&nbsp;
importantly, Luffy doesn't like to kill people,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:20.040
and this deadly poison would definitely lead&nbsp;
to more deaths than in the original story.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:25.500
So unless Luffy can make a poison that&nbsp;
just knocks out or paralyzes opponents,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:32.040
then this actually isn’t THE PERFECT&nbsp;
second devil fruit for Luffy.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:37.140
Which is why the Brain fruit might be even&nbsp;
better for Luffy. Because I think we can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:41.940
all agree that Luffy is pretty much an idiot&nbsp;
outside of battle. But if he could learn and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:46.080
remember all of the incredible things&nbsp;
he experiences throughout the story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:52.140
he would truly be a genius in the world.&nbsp;
Seriously, he has the world’s best navigator,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:58.440
helmsman, engineer, swordsman, musician,&nbsp;
cook, and archeologist all on his crew,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:06.060
so if he could learn from each of them, he’d&nbsp;
be a literal genius. Plus he might stop getting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:10.140
tricked all the time, although, now that&nbsp;
I’m thinking about it, I wonder if Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:15.420
would actually have to read for this fruit to&nbsp;
work. So… nevermind. Brain fruit in the trash.

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:22.980
But before we get to the next absolutely&nbsp;
insane second power we could add to Luffy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:29.940
we first need to clarify that we don’t know if it&nbsp;
is possible for Luffy to eat two devil fruits. We&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:36.780
were told in chapter 385 by CP9, that eating a&nbsp;
second devil fruit would make that person’s body&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:47.760
explode. This is possibly because the spirits of&nbsp;
the fruits couldn’t live together in one body,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:55.440
but we don’t really know for sure. That’s why&nbsp;
it was so surprising when Blackbeard showed us&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.440 --> 00:07:00.540
that he could use both the darkness fruit and&nbsp;
the Tremor fruit at the same time. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:06.120
there are lots of theories about why he can&nbsp;
do this, for example, his special logia fruit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:10.620
or that Blackbeard might actually be more&nbsp;
than one person. But I also think it would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:19.500
be hilarious if anyone could eat two devil&nbsp;
fruits and that the rumor was false all along.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:23.280
So back to Luffy. Now we are going to&nbsp;
take our normal rubber straw hat captain,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:30.480
feed him this devil fruit, and watch as he&nbsp;
evolves into… Chop Chop Luffy. And to show&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:36.360
you just how MINDBLOWINGLY perfect this&nbsp;
power would be for Luffy, let’s go back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:42.720
to this scene at Marineford where Mihawk is about&nbsp;
to slice Luffy into swiss cheese. Luckily though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:48.780
Luffy throws Buggy in front like a shield, and&nbsp;
the clown tanks the blow. But in our new scenario,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:55.380
Luffy doesn’t even need his Buggy shield, since&nbsp;
his Chop Chop powers literally make him immune&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.380 --> 00:08:02.940
to damage from any type of blade. Slashes?&nbsp;
Nu-uh. Cuts? Goodbye. Even overpowered bites&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:12.000
or anything sharp like spikes are now ABSOLUTELY&nbsp;
USELESS against Luffy. And this is HUGE for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:17.160
straw hat captain since these types of attacks&nbsp;
are one of the main ways that he is seriously&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:22.440
injured in the story, like when he was stabbed&nbsp;
by Crocodile and Katakuri or when he gets bitten&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:29.160
by Rob Lucci. But this incredible defense&nbsp;
isn’t the only upgrade to Chop Chop Luffy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:34.680
because now he can pretty much fly as we see&nbsp;
Buggy do many times throughout the story. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:40.080
he can only use this ability as long as his feet&nbsp;
stay on the ground. The author of One Piece even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:48.360
drew us this diagram to demonstrate how it works.&nbsp;
However, with Luffy’s combined powers, his range&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:53.700
might extend even further than Buggy’s since&nbsp;
he can stretch his body further. And honestly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:59.040
I can see so many creative ways for Luffy&nbsp;
to attack if he can separate his arms and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:04.860
legs that he could simply overwhelm enemies&nbsp;
by attacking from so many different angles.

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:09.540
Plus the ability to fly could help the&nbsp;
crew scout, which would have definitely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:14.100
come in handy during the Skypiea arc when&nbsp;
the crew was lost in the jungle. Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:18.060
might also have been able to climb back up&nbsp;
to the arc maxim much easier, which could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:22.860
have meant Enel wouldn’t have been able to&nbsp;
even summon his strongest attack. Although,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:28.200
Luffy might get more distracted since he&nbsp;
can fly around, and there is the obvious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:33.000
weakness to kicks in the balls. However,&nbsp;
there is one big disclaimer for this fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:38.700
which is that we don’t know if this fruit is&nbsp;
weak to haki or not. For example, if Mihawk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:49.500
coated his blade with haki, could he damage Buggy?&nbsp;
If so that would be a major nerf for this fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:55.320
but we aren’t really sure since we’ve never seen&nbsp;
a clear example. Though we are explicitly told&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.320 --> 00:10:01.500
he is immune to all blades, so there is a good&nbsp;
chance haki blades still don’t affect this fruit.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:08.520
Which you might disagree with, but no one can&nbsp;
disagree with how perfect these next fruits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:14.220
are for Luffy. And these are so overpowered&nbsp;
for Luffy that they surpass simple fighting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:19.440
power and take Luffy to the next level of&nbsp;
overpowered. That’s because I’m talking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:24.600
about the Biscuit fruit and the Cook fruit,&nbsp;
which were both introduced during the whole&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:29.580
cake island arc. And since both of them allow&nbsp;
the user to make an unlimited supply of food,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:35.940
Luffy will never have to worry about going hungry&nbsp;
again. Which is undoubtedly a perfect power for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:40.980
Luffy since he has such a bottomless pit for&nbsp;
a stomach. Kinda just like how you are the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:45.180
perfect person to subscribe to the channel&nbsp;
for more one piece content just like this.

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:51.540
But even unlimited food is not the best power up&nbsp;
we can give Luffy, because this next devil fruit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:58.800
is going to take things to a whole new level.&nbsp;
That’s because since Luffy fights with flying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:05.040
punches, ax kicks, and slamming head butts, there&nbsp;
is no greater power boost than simply giving him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:11.580
more arms, legs, and heads to fight with. Which&nbsp;
means that Nico Robin’s Flower fruit is simply&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:15.420
the greatest second devil fruit that Luffy could&nbsp;
eat. ADD MORE EXCITING BITS AND GEAR 5 SECTION

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:20.460
Don’t believe me? Well, keep in mind that this&nbsp;
fruit allows the user to make copies of any part&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:28.020
of the user’s body and place them anywhere within&nbsp;
a certain range. WHICH IS SUCH AN OP ABILITY,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:33.360
especially for Gear 5 Luffy as we will see in&nbsp;
just a second. But there’s even more because for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:38.160
fighting there are endless attacks that she uses&nbsp;
by sprouting limbs. We have the famous Clutch,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:43.080
Slam, and even super sized versions&nbsp;
of these attacks. These powers are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:47.040
also great in a supporting role since&nbsp;
Robin can make copies of her eyes and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:52.740
ears to spy or combine her limbs into things&nbsp;
like nets and wings, which allow her to fly.

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:59.460
And for Luffy these powers would&nbsp;
ABSOLUTELY take his fighting style&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:04.620
to GOD-TIER level. He instantly has&nbsp;
more arms and legs to fight with,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:09.900
so with his rubber he could surround enemies&nbsp;
with a storm of punches and kicks that would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:15.300
CRUSH any fighter’s endurance. Kinda like how&nbsp;
Katakuri made extra mochi arms to completely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:20.640
pummel Luffy back on Whole Cake island These&nbsp;
powers would also allow Luffy to get around much&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:26.040
easier since he could fly across islands or swing&nbsp;
his way through tight places like in Impel Down.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:30.720
But that’s not even the ultimate ability of this&nbsp;
fruit, because the final power up that Robin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:37.320
showed us in Wano might even allow Luffy to use a&nbsp;
famous technique from another ultra popular anime.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:43.200
That’s because Robin’s strongest ability allows&nbsp;
her to literally make normal or giant sized clones&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:50.160
of herself to fight against opponents. So just&nbsp;
imagine Luffy busting out the Shadow Clone Jutsu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:56.940
to make a ton of copies of himself. This would&nbsp;
especially be useful in brutal fights against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:56.940 --> 00:13:01.620
some of the strongest pirates in the world,&nbsp;
such as when he battles Kaido. I mean can you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:07.620
just imagine a hundred advanced conqueror haki&nbsp;
fists slamming down on the Emperor? That fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:14.040
might have been over before Luffy ever unlocked&nbsp;
Gear 5. And especially if Luffy could combine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:19.500
his clones with his other gear techniques,&nbsp;
then Luffy would be nearly unstoppable,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:24.720
though he’d have to increase his stamina quite&nbsp;
a bit to keep up with that many powerful clones.

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:32.940
Plus just imagine having multiple Luffy’s. MAN,&nbsp;
IT WOULD PROBABLY BREAK THE WORLD! I can just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:38.700
picture one giant Luffy throwing down lightning&nbsp;
bolts on Kaido while ANOTHER giant Luffy rains&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:45.780
down firey punches. With these two powers&nbsp;
combined, he would be an UNSTOPPABLE GOD.

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:50.580
However, even though the Flower fruit is&nbsp;
undoubtedly the best fruit to pair with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:55.020
Luffy’s original devil fruit powers, that&nbsp;
doesn’t mean that this version of Luffy is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:55.020 --> 00:14:01.500
the strongest we could imagine. Because I have&nbsp;
to admit that seeing Luffy flying around as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:07.380
giant Red Dragon is just such an awesome idea&nbsp;
that I made a video about what would happen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:13.680
if Luffy ate each of the Yonko fruits instead of&nbsp;
his own. And you can watch that video right here.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:18.240
Shanks for watching and I’ll&nbsp;
see you in the next one.

